    family-names: Madani
    affiliation: Otto von Guericke University Magdeburg
repository-code: https://github.com/PedramMadani/spec-gate
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Requirements-Sufficiency-Gated Automation (RSGA) as an
  MCP server: it refuses to let an agent start on an underspecified request and commits
  a record of what was missing, what was assumed and who authorised proceeding.
